  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A blank tally sheet for recording vaccinations, the same as the previous one but with three age columns: 0-11 months, 12-23 months and 24 months or older, each with tally circles and a total, and a total-vaccinated column. Rows list BCG, Hep B BD, OPV 0-3, IPV, Penta 1-3, Rota 1-3, PCV 1-3, M/MR 1 and 2, DTP4/Other, vitamin A and long-lasting insecticidal net. Cells that do not apply are shaded dark: Hep B BD and OPV 0 for 12 months and older; Rota 1-3 for 24 months or older; M/MR 2, DTP4/Other and the net for 0-11 months. A footnote marks Rota 3, DTP4/Other and the net as depending on national health priorities and schedule of services.",
